! RIM WFR: the fans' wave aberration (OPD, waves of each fan's wavelength)
! instead of the transverse ray aberration (CODE V RIM WFR).  The values are
! the legacy fan OPD (YFAN/XFAN OPD).  Checked against the CAPFN wavefront
! (PMA): on axis within 2e-5 waves (radial fit of the 33x33 map), at 10 deg
! within 5e-6 waves (map extrapolated to pupil x = 0).
RES osdtriplet
RIM ; WFR Y ; GO
RIM ; WFR Y ; SETWV 1 ; SETDENS 17 ; GO
! back to transverse
RIM ; WFR N ; SETWV 1 ; SETDENS 17 ; GO
! bad input
RIM ; WFR MAYBE ; GO
